{"title":"Career roadmap · UI Designer","role":"UI Designer","summary":"A UI Designer designs the visual interface of digital products such as websites, mobile applications, SaaS platforms, dashboards, fintech products, healthcare applications, e-commerce platforms, and emerging AI interfaces.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career alignment"},{"type":"p","text":"A UI Designer designs the visual interface of digital products such as websites, mobile applications, SaaS platforms, dashboards, fintech products, healthcare applications, e-commerce platforms, and emerging AI interfaces."},{"type":"p","text":"A B.Des in UI/UX & Interaction Design is directly aligned with this career. The strongest candidates combine visual design + interaction design + UX research + design systems + prototyping + accessibility + product thinking + front-end awareness."},{"type":"note","label":"Important distinction","text":"A UI Designer primarily owns the visual and interactive interface. UX Designers focus more heavily on user research, information architecture, flows, usability, and overall experience. In many companies, these responsibilities overlap under titles such as Product Designer or UX/UI Designer."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"UI Design Intern, UX/UI Design Intern, Junior UI Designer"}],[{"text":"Early Career"},{"text":"UI Designer, Visual Designer, Interaction Designer"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"Senior UI Designer, Product Designer"}],[{"text":"Advanced"},{"text":"Lead Product Designer, Design Lead"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Design Manager, Design Director"}],[{"text":"Specialist"},{"text":"Design Systems Designer, Accessibility Designer, AI Interface Designer"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build During the B.Des","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","tex